Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.60,0:01:07.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,《洛奇3》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.20,0:00:46.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是盲目的本能反应!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's blind instinct!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.23,0:00:50.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在奎迪回来了  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now it is Creed comin'back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.23,0:00:53.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奎迪击出了左拳  是什么使这两个人撑下去的? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Creed with a left hand! What's keepin' these two guys up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.25,0:00:55.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个惊人的闭幕时刻!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A tremendous closing moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.21,0:01:02.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,此刻巴尔博亚又起来了  拳王也是又打出一记左拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here comes Balboa back, but the champion back with another left!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.22,0:01:09.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是如何起来的我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did they getting out here, I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:11.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一记右拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A right hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.21,0:01:14.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是奎迪打的  现在换巴尔博亚了  现在又换成奎迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} It's Creed! Now it's Balboa! Now it's Creed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.23,0:01:16.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇打出了一记惊人的左拳 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now a tremendous left by Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.19,0:01:18.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们面对面地站在擂台的中央\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're standing dead in the center of the ring, toe-to-toe!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.25,0:01:37.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.21,0:01:42.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.21,0:01:45.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奎迪将能保住他的头衔  如果没人站起来的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Creed will retain the title! If neither gets up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.24,0:01:48.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是平手  奎迪就能保住头衔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's a draw, and Creed will win the title!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.20,0:01:49.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.25,0:01:51.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 老兄  起来吧  - 五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get up!  - Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.28,0:01:55.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,六\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.24,0:01:57.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两位选手都想打败读秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each trying to beat the count!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.25,0:01:59.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.22,0:02:00.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 八  - 他在发抖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Eight.  - He's trembling!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.23,0:02:03.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.25,0:02:06.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 冠军倒下去了  - 十\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The champ is down!  - Ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.27,0:02:07.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你出局了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.19,0:02:09.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He won!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.24,0:02:11.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在最后一秒时办到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's done it at the last second!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.25,0:02:15.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚站起来他办到了  洛奇巴尔博亚震惊了世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa got on his feet and he made it!  Rocky Balboa has shocked the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:19.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是新任的世界重量级冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is the new heavyweight champion of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.21,0:02:22.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位女士先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.25,0:02:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在惊人的出乎意料中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a stunning upset...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.26,0:02:27.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以一次击倒而赢得了胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}scoring a win by a knockout...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.19,0:02:30.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新任世界重量级冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the new heavyweight champion of the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.23,0:02:35.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你很棒  - 洛奇巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You were great.   - Rocky Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.20,0:02:38.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.26,0:02:44.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想告诉家里的妻子一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanna say one thing to my wife, who's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.20,0:02:49.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  我办到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Adrian! I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.20,0:02:53.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你  我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.21,0:03:23.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(世界冠军洛奇)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.22,0:03:39.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(洛奇赢得第一次头衔保卫战)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:44.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(洛奇巴尔博亚对抗裘萨克)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.24,0:04:05.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(洛奇巴尔博亚对抗美国重炮)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.22,0:04:28.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(洛奇击倒了德国冠军)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.21,0:04:39.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(洛奇已准备好第六次头衔保卫战)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.25,0:05:08.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(克劳伯廉第六度残忍地击倒对手)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.25,0:05:25.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(克劳伯廉现在排名第八)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.24,0:05:32.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放马过来  来啊  出拳打我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on! Bring it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.24,0:05:34.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来  快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come back! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:52.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是提线木偶表演!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the Muppet Show!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.27,0:05:55.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚  洛奇巴尔博亚!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight, Rocky Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.25,0:06:40.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要巴尔博亚  我要巴尔博亚  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want Balboa!  I want Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.23,0:06:42.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到没  老头子  叫洛奇敢就让他来找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hear that, old man? You tell Balboa to come here if he wants!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.26,0:06:45.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人能击败我  你告诉他我所说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody can beat me! You tell him what I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.21,0:06:47.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是下一个了  我要宰了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he's next! I'm gonna kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.21,0:06:48.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉巴尔博亚  没有人能阻止我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody can stop me! You tell Balboa that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.24,0:06:51.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会追着他的  你告诉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm comin' after him! You tell him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.26,0:06:53.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想冲击拳王宝座\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want a shot at the title.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.25,0:06:56.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果巴尔博亚玩这个游戏   他会在拳坛上或别处见到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Balboa's got the guts, he'll meet me in the ring or anywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.25,0:06:59.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一生都在争取这头衔为目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My whole life was directed towards this here title, and nothin'else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.28,0:07:01.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我独自生活跟训练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I live alone and I train alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.27,0:07:04.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会独自赢得头衔的  我吃定他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll win the title alone. I want him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.20,0:07:07.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没法永远避开我  他避的了一时避不了一世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can't duck me forever. He can run, but he can't hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.27,0:07:09.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是一个左撇子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, another southpaw...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.26,0:07:13.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重量级拳王洛奇巴尔博亚  似乎不太担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}heavyweight champion Rocky Balboa, doesn't seem to be worried about much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.23,0:07:15.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他刚卫冕了第十次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's just defended his title for the tenth time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.27,0:07:19.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且已同意参加重量级摔角比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's even agreed to take on the world's heavyweight wrestling champion...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.22,0:07:20.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目的是慈善义演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a sort of charity benefit...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.26,0:07:23.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所得将捐给青年基金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with all the proceeds to go to a local youth foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.24,0:07:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我必须称赞他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I'll have to give him credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.24,0:07:28.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚先生设法使自己忙碌  他是个真正的运动员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Balboa manages to stay busy. He's a true sportsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:31.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的头号对手克劳伯廉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it looks like the number-one contender Clubber Lang...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.25,0:07:33.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将必须等待了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will have to continue to play the waiting game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.26,0:07:36.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那应该是一场伟大的比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that should be a great, great matchup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.21,0:07:37.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利  放轻松点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it easy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:43.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要走了吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you goin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.25,0:07:46.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘了向洛奇表达我的问候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget to give Rocky my best, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.23,0:07:49.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道  我来这好几年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I've been comin' here years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.24,0:07:55.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利  你给我你的问候如何? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about you give me, Paulie, your best once?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.24,0:07:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利  轻松点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it easy, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.21,0:08:00.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(胜利的季节)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.26,0:08:01.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利  你听到了吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulie, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.19,0:08:05.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你见到洛奇时 告诉他我们都跟他问好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you see the Rock, tell him the boys all say "hey"!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.24,0:08:48.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forty thousand!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:57.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拿到了另一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.27,0:09:53.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.27,0:10:01.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想听我欠你的吗?  我什么也没欠你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna hear "I owe ya"?  You I owe nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.49,0:10:04.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的确没欠我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you don't owe me nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.21,0:10:06.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你希望我做什么? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what do you want I should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.24,0:10:09.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我妹妹不在这吗?  - 她在家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My sister ain't here?  - She's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.23,0:10:12.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道  我和她一直都很亲密  直到你出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, me and her used to be tight until you come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.27,0:10:15.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把她养大  她却不来探望我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I raised her, she don't come down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.24,0:10:17.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她并不知道这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She don't know about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.27,0:10:19.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗  你跟她都可以下地狱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can up and go to hell, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.28,0:10:21.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利  小心你的用词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, watch your mouth, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.23,0:10:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想揍我吗?  我不会让你辛苦的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gonna whack me? I don't sweat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.26,0:10:26.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会让你辛苦的  来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't sweat you. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.22,0:10:28.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利  得了吧  为什么不把你的头脑弄清醒点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Paulie. Why don't you screw your head on right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.28,0:10:32.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不是我的脑袋  是你畸形的脑袋出问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it ain't my head. Your freakin' head is the one on wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.26,0:10:33.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
