Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.28,0:21:08.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不准勒他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No choking! No choking!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.22,0:21:16.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会让你辛苦的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't sweat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.20,0:21:26.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撑下去  孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on! Hang on there, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.24,0:21:30.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得如何? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you like it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.22,0:21:32.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还真可爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're kinda cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.24,0:21:33.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.19,0:21:35.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇完全地勒住了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky is out-and-out strangling him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.23,0:21:41.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇就像牛头犬般地撑着  现在洛奇正在勒他的颈子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky hanging on like a bull terrier. Now he's got him in a stranglehold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.21,0:21:51.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,攻击身体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The body!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.22,0:21:58.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他的脑袋打掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knock his block off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.22,0:22:07.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 大树要倒了!  - 不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Timber!  - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.26,0:22:14.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真是难以置信  洛奇真的做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's unbelievable! Rocky actually did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.21,0:22:17.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那庞然大物被丢到擂台外去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A human skyscraper's been thrown out of the ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.27,0:22:19.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  就这样  时间到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, that's it. Time is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.20,0:22:27.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位女士先生  结果是平手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen, we have a draw. A draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.26,0:22:33.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们来参加  第12届年度慈善比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, one and all, for attending the 12th annual charity match
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.22,0:22:35.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由意大利杜马洛奇巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}between the Italian Stallion Rocky Balboa...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.20,0:22:38.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和终极男人雷吻演出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Thunderlips, the ultimate male.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.21,0:22:40.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明年再见了  谢天谢地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you next year. Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.25,0:22:42.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧?  - 是  很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you all right?  - Yeah, pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.20,0:22:44.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good match.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.26,0:22:46.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在台上为什么对我那么狂暴? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd you get so crazy on me out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.28,0:22:48.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是比赛的实质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the name of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.28,0:22:52.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁你还平静的时候  我们能一起拍张拍立得吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While you're still calm, can we get that Polaroid together?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.26,0:22:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然  没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.28,0:22:58.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  过来  这是我妻子艾莉  我小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian, come on over here. My wife Adrian, my kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.19,0:23:00.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是雷吻  你会拍照吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Thunderlips. Al, would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.19,0:23:01.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那样很痛  - 没关系的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That hurt.  - Okay, that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.25,0:23:06.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道  有时慈善反倒是伤人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, sometimes charity really hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.25,0:23:09.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(洛奇和雷吻募集了 七万五千元)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.20,0:23:14.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小木偶说谎  所以他的鼻子开始变长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pinocchio told a lie, and his nose started growin' real big.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.19,0:23:15.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么不是他的耳朵? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't his ears grow?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.25,0:23:18.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  我不是故事的作者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I didn't write the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.19,0:23:20.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又要打拳了吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you fighting again?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.24,0:23:23.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天?  不  今天我不打算打拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today?  No, I don't plan on fightin' today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.22,0:23:26.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你保证?  - 保证  绝对不打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Promise?  - Promise. Definitely I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.23,0:23:27.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我喜欢你在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. I like you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.27,0:23:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也喜欢在这里  你饿了吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?  I like bein' here. Are you gettin' hungry, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.22,0:23:33.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要麦片吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want some Wheaties?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.26,0:23:35.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么是麦片?   - 冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are Wheaties, huh?   - Champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.25,0:23:38.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么的早餐?  冠军  - 冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Breakfast of what?  Champions.  - Champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.27,0:23:42.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熊爸爸说 "有人在我床上睡觉"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the father bear, he says, "Somebody's been sleepin'in my bed. "
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.20,0:23:45.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而小熊也说 "有人在我床上睡觉"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the little kid bear said "Somebody's been sleepin' in my bed,"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.20,0:23:47.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"她在那里"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"and there she is."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.21,0:23:49.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因此  它把被子掀开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thereby he pulls back the covers...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.24,0:23:53.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使她显露在大家面前  懂吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and thereby exposing her to the, you know, public, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.20,0:23:55.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来  趁麦片还没沉淀把它吃掉吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, eat your cereal before it sinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.20,0:23:56.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后那位金发美女怎么了? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then what happened to Goldilocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.95,0:23:59.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她怎么了  我也不太确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to her?  I'm not exactly sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.20,0:24:01.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因非法侵入被抓  并关在牢里三十天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Busted for trespassin' and got 30 days in the clink.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.78,0:24:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利  这样跟孩子说还真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's real nice, Paulie. That's nice to tell the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.24,0:24:08.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  车子在等着呢 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky, the car is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.20,0:24:10.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们最好快去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys better go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.22,0:24:14.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你要乖乖的  - 我们在这会很有趣  我和孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Be a good boy now.  - We'll have a fun time, me and the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.22,0:24:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杜马太太  你看起来真漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Mrs. Stallion, you almost look pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.21,0:24:19.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, thank you, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.25,0:24:21.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让那孩子喝啤酒  好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't give the kid any beer, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.23,0:24:25.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利  我们得走了  别把他带到竞赛场上  好吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we gotta go. And Paulie, don't take him to the track, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.20,0:24:26.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米克  你好吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How ya doin', Mick?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.65,0:24:28.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.22,0:24:31.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在  我们在第七局遇到问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, we got a problem in the seventh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.24,0:24:56.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管曾发生了什么  现在是宁静柔和的时刻  对吧? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever happened to them quiet, tender moments, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.19,0:25:15.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  谢谢大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Thank you, one and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.28,0:25:20.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偶而总有人会挑战可能性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every once in a while, a person comes along who defies the odds...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.28,0:25:22.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挑战逻辑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who defies logic...
