Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.28,0:25:30.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我代表费城所有的市民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On behalf of all the citizens of Philadelphia...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.21,0:25:33.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和其他被你的成就所感动的人们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the many who have been touched by your accomplishments...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.19,0:25:38.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,及被你不知疲倦地参加本市许多慈善活动所感动的人们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and your untiring participation in this city's many charity functions...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.21,0:25:41.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很荣幸地  呈献这座纪念碑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it is with tremendous honor that we present this memorial...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.20,0:25:45.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它将会永远歌颂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which will stand always as a celebration...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.24,0:25:48.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类不屈服的精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the indomitable spirit of man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.23,0:25:52.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,费城向他最喜爱的子民致敬 洛奇巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Philadelphia salutes its favorite son Rocky Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.24,0:26:05.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太美了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.19,0:26:08.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对是件杰作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Definitely a thing of beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.19,0:26:25.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.25,0:26:31.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感谢大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you very much.
