Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.23,0:26:44.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大约三年前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About three years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.23,0:26:46.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this city...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.26,0:26:51.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的感动了我  你们知道吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}really took me inside, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.25,0:26:58.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我想为此好好地感谢你们  真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I want to thank you very much for that. I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.21,0:27:03.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在想  我不打算提起这个的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I've been thinkin' that I wasn't gonna bring this up,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.21,0:27:05.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我现在可能要提了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I might as well now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.22,0:27:09.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝不会做任何事来伤害这运动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would never do anything to to hurt this sport
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.23,0:27:13.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它使我获益匪浅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that has been so really good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.24,0:27:16.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直和我的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I've been talkin' it over with my wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.27,0:27:19.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,及我的经纪人谈起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and my manager...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.20,0:27:22.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we think that
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.28,0:27:26.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真的很难启齿  我觉得好像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's really hard to I feel like, well
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.24,0:27:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想也许是我该…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm thinkin' maybe it's time that I should...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.22,0:27:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下台退休的时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}step down maybe and retire.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.21,0:27:40.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.28,0:27:43.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁还可以的时候退休吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gettin' out while you can?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.23,0:27:46.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别给这蠢货雕像  给他胆子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't give this sucker no statue. Give him guts!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.20,0:27:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过我不会走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you I wasn't goin' away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.28,0:27:50.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你表现过了  现在换我表现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got your shot. Now give me mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.26,0:27:51.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the hell outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.24,0:27:53.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴  老头  我不会走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up, old man! I ain't goin' nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.23,0:27:55.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉这些好乡亲  你为何躲着我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now why don't you tell all these nice folks why you been duckin' me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.27,0:27:58.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是政治  老兄  这国家想打压我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Politics, man. This country wants to keep me down,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.26,0:27:59.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使每个人都软弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}keep everybody weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.27,0:28:03.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不要我赢得头衔  因为我不像他是个傀儡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't want me to have the title because I'm not a puppet like that fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.22,0:28:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗?  你的嘴巴真大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you've got a big mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.43,0:28:08.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚  何不做个了断呢?  来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you come out and close it, Balboa?  Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.26,0:28:09.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随时奉陪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.20,0:28:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他疯了  别听他胡说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guy's crazy. Don't listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.19,0:28:15.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个小人不来找我  那我就说出事实吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The little man don't wanna come to me. I'll come to you and tell the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.63,0:28:17.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是第一流的  一流的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am ranked number one. One!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.62,0:28:18.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那表示我是最优秀的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means I'm the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.66,0:28:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这无赖却挑软柿子吃  跟其他的无赖比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this bum is takin' the easy matches, fightin' other bums.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.57,0:28:24.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉你和在场的所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling you and everybody here...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.20,0:28:26.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我将不收分文  不计时间地点地跟他比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll fight him anywhere, anytime, for nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.46,0:28:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你们不会看到这场比赛的  因为他要退休了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you people ain't never gonna see that happen because he's gonna retire.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.21,0:28:35.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不会和真的男人打的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, he don't fight no real man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.54,0:28:37.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他参加设计过的比赛  - 什么? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He fight them setups.  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.23,0:28:39.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是这个运动中的耻辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a disgrace to this sport!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.22,0:28:42.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴  老头  你不知道我经历过什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up, old man! You and that chump don't know where I had to come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.22,0:28:44.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚  你的家庭很美满  不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa, your family doin' real nice, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.22,0:28:46.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你称自己是个斗士?  证明吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You call yourself a fighter. Prove it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.55,0:28:48.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我同等的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the same chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.23,0:28:50.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你躲我的方式真是个耻辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way you been duckin' this is a disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.23,0:28:53.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他不是懦夫  为何不和我打呢? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he ain't no coward, why don't he fight me then?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.20,0:28:56.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我听不下去了  - 我不管你是第几流的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't listen to any more of this.  - I don't care what you're ranked.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.22,0:28:58.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会有比赛的  我是说真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't get no shot, and I mean that!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.66,0:29:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴你们都看到这一切了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad you're seein' this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.61,0:29:02.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想和他打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna fight this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.29,0:29:03.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  你去和他打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you've got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.52,0:29:05.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不会陪你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you fight him without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.20,0:29:07.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 事情结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you sayin'?   - It's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.27,0:29:10.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  我不做了  我不要再看到这一切了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I'm finished. I don't want no more of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.22,0:29:13.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要再看到这一切了  懂吗?  不要了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want no more of it. You understand?  None of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.28,0:29:16.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 全都结束了  - 用我比赛的记录评价我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's all over with!  - Judge me by my fightin' record.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.28,0:29:20.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女人  那个女人  听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, woman. Hey, woman. Listen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.21,0:29:24.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然你的丈夫没勇气  也许你想看看真正的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since your man ain't got no heart, maybe you'd like to see a real man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.20,0:29:27.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我敢说你每晚都睡不着  梦想能有个真正的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet you stay up late every night dreamin' you had a real man, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.44,0:29:28.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.25,0:29:32.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚你到我公寓来  我给你看看真正的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring yourself over to my apartment tonight, and I'll show you a real man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.56,0:29:35.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想比  那就比吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want it, you got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.25,0:29:39.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随时奉陪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anytime!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.21,0:29:49.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky, don't. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.68,0:29:53.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  拜托  让我们谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky, please, let's go talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.19,0:29:55.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.27,0:29:57.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky. Let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.23,0:30:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为何离开? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd you leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.26,0:30:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为何走得那么急? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd you walk away like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.21,0:30:06.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生命太短暂了  孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life's too short, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.20,0:30:08.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you goin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.26,0:30:11.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去度个永远的假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm goin' on a permanent vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.28,0:30:14.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么?  我们还有一场比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talkin' about? We got one more fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.26,0:30:17.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不是我们  是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not we. You.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.24,0:30:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为何要这么做? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you doin' this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.20,0:30:26.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说你为何要这么做? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, why are you doin' this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.26,0:30:28.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你赢不了的  洛奇!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you can't win, Rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.28,0:30:32.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙可以在三回合内把你打死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy'll kill you to death inside of three rounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.21,0:30:33.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.22,0:30:34.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讲点新鲜的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What else is new?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.26,0:30:36.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只是另一个拳击手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's just another fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.19,0:30:37.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  他不是另一个拳击手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he ain't just another fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.27,0:30:41.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙是个毁灭机器  而且他很有战意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy is a wreckin' machine, and he's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.25,0:30:44.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从赢得冠军之后  就再没有战意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, you ain't been hungry since you won that belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.22,0:30:46.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么?  我已经卫冕十次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talkin' about?  I've had ten title defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.57,0:30:47.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是容易的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.67,0:30:48.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.20,0:30:51.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些都是筛选过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They was handpicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.19,0:30:56.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 设计过的吗?  - 不  不是设计过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Setups?  - No, they weren't setups.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.87,0:31:00.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是很好的拳击手  但他们不像这家伙是个杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They was good fighters, but they wasn't killers like this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.26,0:31:03.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  他可以把你轰到未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll knock you into tomorrow, Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.20,0:31:24.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  米克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Geez, Mick.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.27,0:31:28.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为何要这么做? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.19,0:31:36.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为阿波罗对你的攻击  原本会杀了你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because the beating that you got from Apollo should've killed you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.19,0:31:40.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但却没有  我的工作是让你一直赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It didn't. It was my job to keep you winnin'...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.19,0:31:42.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并让你保持健康\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and to keep you healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.21,0:31:50.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的没有认为  我什么都不剩了  对吧? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really don't think I got nothin' left, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.22,0:31:53.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Rock,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.20,0:31:56.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们这么说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let's put it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.24,0:32:00.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三年前你是能人所不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, three years ago, you was supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.19,0:32:04.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是坚毅而狂暴的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You was hard and you was nasty...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.19,0:32:07.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且你有铸铁般的下颚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you had this cast-iron jaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.21,0:32:12.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但最可怕的事发生在你身上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then the worst thing happened to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.21,0:32:15.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也可能发生在别人身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that could happen to any fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.25,0:32:19.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你变得文明了  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got civilized.  - Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.24,0:32:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心  孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, don't worry, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.24,0:32:31.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道的  总统会退休  将军也会退休  马匹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, presidents retire, generals retire, horses retire,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.54,0:32:34.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和战场上的人都会退休\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man O'War retired.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.25,0:32:36.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们把它用来配种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They put him out to stud.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.27,0:32:40.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那才是你原本该做的  退休\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what you should've done, retire.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.21,0:32:47.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米克  知道这些后我不能退休了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't retire knowin' all this, Mick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.23,0:32:50.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别逼自己  - 你一直照顾着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, don't push it.  - Well, you been carryin' me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.24,0:32:52.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不需要打的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.28,0:32:54.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直在照顾我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been carryin' me though.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.28,0:32:57.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有照顾你  我是在保护你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't been carryin' ya. I been protectin' ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.57,0:33:01.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  听着  我要打这一场  再一场就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's not the way, I want this fight, just one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.19,0:33:04.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们不需要打的  - 我会住到健身房去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But we don't need it.  - I'll live in the gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.20,0:33:07.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们不需要打的  - 米克  我要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We don't need it.  - Mick, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.20,0:33:10.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我求你再训练我最后一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm askin' you to train me one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.23,0:33:12.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.22,0:33:14.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.25,0:33:18.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就告诉大家  你十年没买过一件新内衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell everybody you ain't bought a new pair of underwear in ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.20,0:33:22.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会这么做的  对吧? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.19,0:33:24.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.24,0:33:28.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.22,0:33:29.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.20,0:33:34.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再一次  然后就结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more time, then it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.22,0:33:36.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成交了吗?  来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a deal?  Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.24,0:33:39.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子  这可是你的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your head, kid. It's your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.25,0:33:43.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.22,0:33:45.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了  米克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Mick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.19,0:33:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(重量级冠军每天在这里训练)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.21,0:34:09.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(世界重量级冠军)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.20,0:34:13.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇穿的袍子  刚刚送来的  快来买吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hot off the truck. Clean stuff. Get your robes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.25,0:34:34.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(洛奇)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.21,0:34:39.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一生只有一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Collectors' item! Once in a lifetime!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.19,0:34:41.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来买装饰钮扣吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your buttons here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.19,0:34:43.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不可以直接面对那家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't stand toe-to-toe with this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.26,0:34:46.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则他会把你丢到火星上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or he'll deposit you up there on Mars someplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.20,0:34:49.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他太厉害  太强了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's too tough. He's too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.21,0:34:54.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我们怎能在这肉麻下流的地方训练呢? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen. Now how the hell can we train in this creep joint here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.66,0:34:58.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的意思是  这是一栋有坏名声的房子  不对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, this is kind of a house of ill repute or somethin', isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.30,0:35:00.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么租这里呢? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you rent this joint?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.21,0:35:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样  米克  让我们够派头点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on, Mickey. Let's go out in style, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.26,0:35:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要像样地出去  就得全身而退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna go out in style, go out in one piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.21,0:35:06.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now let's get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.58,0:35:08.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到旧健身房去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get back to the old gym, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.27,0:35:11.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们流些血汗和泪吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get some blood and sweat and tears around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.27,0:35:16.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 能做到吗?   - 请你放松并享受它  好吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can we do that?   - Just relax and enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.28,0:35:21.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米克  他们很喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They love it, Mick.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.19,0:35:31.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来  加油  继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go fight! Fight now. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.23,0:35:34.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油  强悍点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight it, fight it. Get rough, get tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.21,0:35:35.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狠一点  就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get brutal. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.28,0:35:38.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  我能亲你一下吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. Could I get a kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.22,0:35:39.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.24,0:35:41.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚开好吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get outta here, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.22,0:35:44.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就像在动物园里打架一样  这是个动物园  你知道吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like fightin' in a zoo. It's a zoo, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.57,0:35:46.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是这样准备比赛的吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that the way you train for Clubber?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.55,0:35:50.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不会亲你的  他会杀了你  你知道吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He ain't gonna kiss ya. He's gonna kill ya. You know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.23,0:35:52.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续  快滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.19,0:35:58.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  照张像如何? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Rock! How about a picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.25,0:36:00.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好  - 照好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, sure.  - There ya go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.27,0:36:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,速度再快一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put a little speed on there!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.21,0:36:46.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put a little speed on there! That a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.22,0:36:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  这才像样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, this'll tell us the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.27,0:37:00.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快  一边一边来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fast! Side to side.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.20,0:37:03.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一边一边来  洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Side to side, Rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.19,0:37:06.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后面的闭嘴  好吗?  改变你的调子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up back there, can't you?  Change your tune.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.25,0:37:08.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样  出拳  出拳  出拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it! Punch, punch, punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.83,0:37:10.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样  孩子  你是个致命武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it, kid. You're a deadly weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.88,0:37:14.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间到  住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time, time, time. Quit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.23,0:37:16.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,表现不错  加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're okay. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.27,0:37:19.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 在你得肺炎前先穿上它  - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Put this on before you catch pneumonia.  - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.97,0:37:21.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我帮你按摩一下  - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll give you a little rubdown too.  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.96,0:37:23.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, listen, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.66,0:37:27.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不喜欢听别人太多废话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like to hear much of what comes out of people's mouths.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.25,0:37:30.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不喜欢轻声细语的时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I don't like soft-talkin' moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.22,0:37:33.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是当然的  - 但我要告诉你一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's for sure.  - But I just wanted to tell you one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.78,0:37:35.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以你为荣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.28,0:37:39.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢了  - 不客气  孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, thanks a lot.  - That's all right, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.23,0:37:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们离开这里吧  - 米克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-  Let's get outta here.  - Hey, Mick?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.21,0:37:42.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.23,0:37:45.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 等结束后我们该做什么?  - 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What'll we do when it's all over?  - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.21,0:37:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许参加马戏团或什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe join up with a circus.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.28,0:37:50.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对  也许吧  - 好  我们出去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, maybe.  - All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.24,0:37:57.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.49,0:37:59.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位晚上好  我是比尔鲍德温\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening, everyone. Along with Bill Baldwin
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.22,0:38:00.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安  我是赖士图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Stu Nahan,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.25,0:38:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们欢迎你们欣赏今晚的重量级卫冕赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we welcome you to tonight's heavyweight title fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.26,0:38:05.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也许是最值得纪念的比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which may prove to be the most memorable of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.19,0:38:09.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为今晚是卫冕者最后  也许是最艰难的卫冕赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For tonight is the champion's final and perhaps most difficult title defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.22,0:38:11.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  你觉着现在是职业生涯的最佳状态吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky, do you feel you're in the best shape of your career?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.53,0:38:13.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  我感觉很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, absolutely. I feel real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.52,0:38:16.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个致命武器  他是那种人  他也会那么做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a deadly weapon. He's one of a kind, and he's gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.16,0:38:18.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克劳伯  你认为你和巴尔博亚一样快吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clubber, do you think you're as fast as Balboa?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.19,0:38:21.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不想说话  - 克劳伯  为我们跳舞吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll do my talkin' in the ring!  - Clubber, dance for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.25,0:38:26.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好滚开  我想独处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better get outta here! I wanna be alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.25,0:38:29.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在比赛后会退休吗?   - 会  这是最后一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will you retire after this fight?   - This is the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.27,0:38:33.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这以后我和米克都结束了  这是最后一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After this, me and Mick are finished. This is definitely the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.28,0:38:36.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都是寄生虫和吸血鬼  滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Y'all parasites and leeches! Get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.24,0:38:38.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚之后你将会做什么? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What will you do after tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.24,0:38:41.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.23,0:38:45.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 米克  也许加入马戏团是吗?   - 对  享点乐子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe join the circus, eh, Mick?  - Yeah. Have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.39,0:38:47.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  把袍子脱下吧 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, take your robe off!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.23,0:38:51.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过叫你们离开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you to get outta my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.20,0:38:56.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚和我们一起的是前任重量级拳王  阿波罗奎迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With us this evening is the former heavyweight champion Apollo Creed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.23,0:39:00.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对这场比赛有什么预测吗?  你怎么看今晚的比赛? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any predictions on this fight? How do you see this fight going tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.20,0:39:03.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得体力是挑战者较好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel its strength would have to go to the challenger...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.19,0:39:06.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但经验和世界上最硬的头  却是巴尔博亚的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while experience and the world's hardest head would have to go to Rocky Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.55,0:39:07.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我了解的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.20,0:39:11.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  记住  别跟他讨价还价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now remember, Rock. Don't trade with this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.20,0:39:12.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把握时间  打击他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take your time, wear him down...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.28,0:39:15.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但别直接面对他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but don't stand toe-to-toe with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.19,0:39:18.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这混球以前从未打到过15回合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This punk's never been 15 rounds before.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.26,0:39:20.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好好修理他  - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take him good.  - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.23,0:39:21.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好好修理他  - 我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take him good.  - Okay. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.76,0:39:23.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.77,0:39:25.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我预测卫冕者会获胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I predict that the champ's gonna take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.66,0:39:28.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请等一下  你认为卫冕者真的有机会? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now wait a minute. Do you really think the champion can hit that hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.21,0:39:31.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为我为何和你坐在这里到比赛结束?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you think I'm sittin' out here with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.20,0:39:52.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蠢货巴尔博亚  你死了  你完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, sucker! Balboa, you bum! You finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.23,0:39:55.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你彻底完蛋了  废物  我是世上最坏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You through! You washed up! I'm the baddest in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.20,0:39:57.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对我你还没那么坏  - 纸老虎  你说什么? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're not so bad to me.  - What you say, paper champion?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.78,0:39:59.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我像打狗一样地打败你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna beat you like a dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.68,0:40:02.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们能把那猩猩赶回台上去吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't you get that ape back into the ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.62,0:40:05.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你害我等太久了  你得为此付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made me wait too long! You gonna pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.05,0:40:06.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  大嘴巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.65,0:40:10.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他赶出去好吗?  把他赶出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him outta there, can't you?  Get him outta there!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.21,0:40:16.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让开  别挡着我  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me go! Let me go! Get outta my way! Get outta my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.19,0:40:21.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁吗?  我是男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know who I am?  I'm the man!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.24,0:40:24.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只是一堆死肉  我要在台上会你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're nothin' but dead meat! I'll meet you in the ring, sucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.23,0:40:25.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是一堆死肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're dead meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.26,0:40:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.23,0:40:31.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.19,0:40:34.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了?  - 他的心脏 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's wrong?  - It's his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.27,0:40:37.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  怎么回事?  快叫医生来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong, Adrian?  Get a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.22,0:40:39.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快叫医生来  快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody get a doctor! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.23,0:40:44.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米克  坐在这里  把他们赶出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit here, Mick. Get 'em outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.22,0:40:47.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他们赶出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get'em outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.20,0:40:51.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 请你坐在桌上好吗?   - 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mick, will you sit on the table?   - I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.98,0:40:54.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,深呼吸  把这些家伙赶出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just take a deep breath. Get those guys outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.22,0:40:56.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快  米克  你能坐吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! Mick, will you sit on the table?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.23,0:40:58.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利  告诉他们比赛取消了  快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paulie, tell 'em the fight's off. Go on! Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.27,0:41:01.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  比赛不能取消  你是疯了吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fight's not off. Are you outta your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.26,0:41:03.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要继续  你疯了吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fight's on. You crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.22,0:41:06.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 今晚不能继续  - 可以  今晚我们要比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mick, we can't, not tonight. I ain't fightin'.  - Yes, tonight we're gonna fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.26,0:41:08.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能喘口气吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just let me get my breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.24,0:41:10.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这违反了规则或什么吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't I get my breath? Is that against the rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.47,0:41:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利  你能叫医生来吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you please get a doctor, Paulie?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.86,0:41:14.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他正在路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's on his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.19,0:41:17.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米克  我不能像这样地出场比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mick, I can't go out there and fight like this. I can't go out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.19,0:41:19.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出场去吧  快去  好吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now get out in there. Get goin', will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.24,0:41:23.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去修理他  好好修理他  把比赛完成  好吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him good. Get it over with, why don't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.25,0:41:27.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  我该怎么办? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian, what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.20,0:41:30.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什么鬼意思?  你不知道该怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell do you mean, what are you supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.22,0:41:33.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在一起这么多年了  你不知道该怎么办? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all these years together, you don't know what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.23,0:41:34.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该感到惭愧的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You oughta be ashamed of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.27,0:41:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在快去把比赛完成吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now get out there and do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.23,0:41:39.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.22,0:41:42.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.22,0:41:44.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是最强的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.23,0:41:48.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.21,0:41:51.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.68,0:41:59.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉  好好照顾他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrian, take care of him. Take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.19,0:42:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安  各位女士先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, good evening, ladies and gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.20,0:42:08.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎参加特别的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and welcome to the featured event...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.23,0:42:11.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界重量级拳王卫冕赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the heavyweight championship of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.25,0:42:16.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位拳迷  今晚和我们一起的是拳坛上的伟人之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And fans, with us tonight, truly one of the fistic greats...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.23,0:42:20.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他将从擂台旁上来  他就是灾难之王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's coming up from ringside, the Master of Disaster,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.25,0:42:22.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刺痛之王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the King of Sting,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.23,0:42:26.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一的阿波罗奎迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the one and only Apollo Creed!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.26,0:42:30.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他上台了  前世界重量级拳王阿波罗奎迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there he is, the former heavyweight champion of the world Apollo Creed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.97,0:42:33.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他看起来气色很好的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stu, he looks like nine million dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.24,0:42:36.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚出我视线  我不要你没有的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get outta my face! I don't need nothin' you got no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.23,0:42:38.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要过气的拳王在我这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't need no has-been messin' in my corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.26,0:42:41.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我揍你之前  快把你的丑脸移开吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you better get that bad look off your face before I knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.26,0:42:44.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  你想打我吗?  打我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Wanna jump?  Jump. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.28,0:42:46.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  奎迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Creed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.25,0:42:47.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.27,0:42:49.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.20,0:42:53.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  你就像个胆小鬼  你最好快逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, just like a chicken. You better run.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.21,0:43:00.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这蠢货击败  当成给大家的礼物  好吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give everybody a present and drop this chump, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.22,0:43:01.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  祝你幸运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Good luck to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.20,0:43:08.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  各位拳迷  我们开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, fans, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.25,0:43:11.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我左边的是  由蓝色角落出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On my left, in the blue corner...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.25,0:43:13.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由芝加哥呐喊过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hailing from Chicago,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.22,0:43:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,体重达235磅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}weighing in at an even 235 pounds...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.19,0:43:20.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界头号的挑战者  未被击败过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the world's number-one challenger...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.19,0:43:24.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不知道米克怎么了  - 不可战胜的克劳伯廉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I wonder how Mick's doin'.  - the undefeated Clubber Lang!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.20,0:43:28.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是最强的  我是最强的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the best. I'm the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.27,0:43:31.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和克劳伯说过话  有何评论吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and Clubber exchanged words up there. Any comment?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.25,0:43:32.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不予置评\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.28,0:43:34.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而在对角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And his opponent, in the opposite corner...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.23,0:43:39.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在全世界都不必介绍的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}really needing no introduction to the world over.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.21,0:43:42.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的体重刚好201磅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He weighs in at a trim 201 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.28,0:43:47.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,费城的荣耀  意大利杜马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pride of Philadelphia the Italian Stallion
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.27,0:43:52.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首屈一指的世界重量级拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the reigning heavyweight champion of the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.19,0:43:55.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.65,0:44:00.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听听观众的欢呼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to this crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.23,0:44:08.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位是裁判马提邓肯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now to give instructions in the middle of the ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.25,0:44:11.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位是裁判马提邓肯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the referee, Marty Denkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.57,0:44:16.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克劳伯  洛奇  你们知道规则的  我要一场干净的比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clubber, Rocky, you know the rules. I want a good, clean fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.27,0:44:19.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你们照我的命令后退并分开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I tell you to break, I want you to step back at my command and break.
