Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.04,0:51:03.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还有更多事要做  我们要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got more to do. We got...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.10,0:51:06.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.06,0:51:09.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.11,0:52:11.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仪式结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This concludes our service.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.09,0:52:32.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(纪念敬爱的米克高密尔  1905年4月7日-1981年8月15日)
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.12,0:54:41.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(米克  伟大的拳击)
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.56,0:55:06.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是正确的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not the way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.61,0:55:08.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.58,0:55:12.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为何不直接打击他?  直接靠近他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should hit it straight. Step into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.62,0:55:16.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.60,0:55:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  我在你家等了一小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. I waited at your house for about an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.61,0:55:21.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太太说你可能在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your wife said you might be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.59,0:55:24.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来这干嘛? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.59,0:55:25.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来办正事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Business.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.60,0:55:31.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果报社知道我们这样谈话  他们会以为我们疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the papers knew we were talking like this, they'd think we was crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.34,0:55:33.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为何这样? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.58,0:55:36.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我是最好的  而你需要人来教你一些不同的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause I'm the best, and you need somebody to teach you different.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.61,0:55:38.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.57,0:55:41.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不认为没有我的话  你能挽回颓势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To be honest, I don't think you can pull it off without me, Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.55,0:55:43.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是没回答我  阿波罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still didn't give me the answer. Apollo
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.54,0:55:44.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正的原因是什么? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the real reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.62,0:55:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  现在很宁静不是吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen. It's quiet, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.60,0:55:51.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你退休  一切都太宁静了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you retire it's too quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.55,0:55:54.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之我们都太年轻了  不能退休\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're too young to retire anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.15,0:55:56.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,此外  用正确的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, with the right touch...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.17,0:55:59.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以把这件事  推进有史以来最伟大境界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could promote this thing into the gate of all time.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.34,0:56:00.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比我们想像的还大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'd be bigger than ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.62,0:56:04.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天知道  我不介意名利双收\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heaven knows, I don't mind being involved with large numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.58,0:56:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.59,0:56:09.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再也不要了  我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need this no more. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.56,0:56:11.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再也不要了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want this no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.54,0:56:13.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.60,0:56:17.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你打败我时  我伤心的要命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you beat me, I hurt all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.58,0:56:20.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想知道任何人的事  甚至是我孩子的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't want to know from nobody, not even my kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.60,0:56:23.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个拳击手都知道失败很伤人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every fighter knows that hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.61,0:56:27.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们试着要和受伤的内心共存  所以现在别退缩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get sick inside trying to live with it. Don't back off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.53,0:56:30.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了自己  你得把它做对  否则你会遗憾的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it right for yourself or you'll be sorry you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.54,0:56:35.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都曾有过世上最伟大的头衔  宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We held the greatest title in the whole world, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.56,0:56:38.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你输了那场比赛  只为了错误的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lost that fight for all the wrong reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.61,0:56:40.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你失去了你的优势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lost your edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.56,0:56:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我知道你的经纪人死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I know your manager dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.53,0:56:46.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使你内心一团糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had you all messed up inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.55,0:56:50.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但事实是你没有战意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the truth is, you didn't look hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.59,0:56:52.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我们比赛时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we fought
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.58,0:56:56.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有老虎般的眼神  那就是优势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you had that eye of the tiger, man the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.58,0:57:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得把它找回来  把它找回来的方法就是从头开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you gotta get it back and the way to get it back is to go back to the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.56,0:57:01.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我的意思吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.58,0:57:06.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许我们可以一起把它赢回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we could win it back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.62,0:57:09.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老虎般的眼神  男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eye of the tiger, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.77,0:57:16.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要来呢? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd you have to come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.79,0:57:20.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有计划  卷土重来  男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have the plan. Get back, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.81,0:57:24.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你使我好奇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got me curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.81,0:57:28.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  你也使我好奇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got me curious, Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.78,0:57:36.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克劳伯  你接受跟巴尔博亚的重赛吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clubber, do you accept the challenge for a rematch with Balboa?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.78,0:57:40.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拒绝挑战  因为巴尔博亚根本不是个挑战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I reject the challenge, because Balboa is no challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.02,0:57:42.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我很乐意再多揍他一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'll be more than happy to beat up on him some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.78,0:57:44.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我总是说他什么也不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always said he was nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.76,0:57:46.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等不及要看那蠢蛋失败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't wait to see him fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.74,0:57:49.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为  他被阿波罗训练的事如何? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think of him being trained by Apollo Creed?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.75,0:57:50.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo who?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.79,0:57:52.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那个老傻子阿波罗奎迪吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You talkin'about that old fool Apollo Creed?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.82,0:57:57.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 过气的人教另一个过气的人  - 对  继续说吧  老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One has-been teaching another.  - Just keep talking, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.75,0:58:00.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我见到他时会让他闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I see him, I'm gonna close it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.74,0:58:03.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  比赛何时举行? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. When will the match take place?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.82,0:58:05.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越快越好  我是世界冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sooner the better. I'm the champion of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.77,0:58:09.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是无庸置疑的  我不能被打败  也不会被打败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Ain't nothin'can be done about that. I can't be beat and I won't be beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.75,0:58:11.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次我要练得更认真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time I'm gonna train even harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.74,0:58:14.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会很快击倒他  我要折磨他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There won't be no quick knockdowns. I'm gonna torture him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.42,0:58:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要好好地虐待他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna crucify him real bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.17,0:58:19.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是硬汉说的硬话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hard words from a hard man.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.18,0:58:24.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚想在三十四岁  东山再起的胜算是很渺茫的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The odds against Balboa making a comeback at 34 are very long indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.97,0:58:27.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他做的到吗?  大部分专家都怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can he do it?  Most experts doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.00,0:58:32.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚曾是很好的冠军  但他的时代已过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa was a fine champion, but his time has passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.11,0:58:34.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我祝他好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish him luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.05,0:58:36.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  别听他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't listen to it, Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.13,0:58:39.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  听他的  洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, do listen to it, Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.18,0:58:44.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比赛结束后  许多民众将欠你一个郑重的道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When this is over, a lot of folks are gonna owe you an engraved apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.31,0:58:47.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你也将欠我一个大人情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're gonna owe me a big favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.79,0:58:49.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么人情? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.62,0:58:52.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等比赛结束后吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.73,0:59:00.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  来吧  我们快来不及去机场了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocko, come on. We're gonna be late at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.78,0:59:03.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们走吧  - 你想我们忘了带什么吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go.  - Have you forgot anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.73,0:59:06.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我想我们都带了  - 也许再带一件毛衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think we have it all.  - Maybe another sweater.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.39,0:59:08.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  加州可没那么冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah, California's not that cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.77,0:59:09.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好极了  上车吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's great. It's scorching.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.74,0:59:12.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我要你乖乖的  好吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I want you to be a good boy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.77,0:59:16.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好的  - 别让任何人头痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay.  - And don't give anybody a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.80,0:59:18.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲我一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.29,0:59:28.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 下飞机后我们会打电话回来  - 对  我们会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We'll call when we land.  - Yeah, we'll call.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.76,0:59:35.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会听话吗?  好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be a good boy?  All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.84,0:59:37.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会带东西回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll bring you back something.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.41,1:00:25.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在洛杉矶要做什么? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are we doin' here in L.A.?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.38,1:00:27.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 老兄  这是我开始的地方  - 那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is where I started.  - So?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.41,1:00:29.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是他开始的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this is where he's startin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.39,1:00:32.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个地方让人厌恶  我们为何不留在你那儿? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place is disgusting. Why don't we stay at your place?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.35,1:00:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你错过重点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you're missing the point.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.42,1:00:35.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们先登记再到体育馆去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Let's check in and get over to the gym.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.04,1:00:38.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为我们不需要这地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rock, in my opinion, we don't need this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.41,1:00:40.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里不符合你的标准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is below you and the sister's standard.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.40,1:00:43.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得试试看  来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta give it a try. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.42,1:00:56.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我连把枪都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't even have a gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.38,1:01:07.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣是有趣  我喜欢这类东西  但我不喜欢这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, fun is fun. I like those kinds of things. But this I don't like.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.34,1:01:12.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看这地方  老鼠甚至都不想待在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this place. Rats even have more pride than to be caught dead here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.41,1:01:17.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说  你看那些垃圾  我不喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, look at the dump. I just don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.36,1:01:20.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为艾莉的健康着想吧  - 保利  我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Think of Adrian's health.  - I'm fine, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.35,1:01:45.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是巴尔博亚  他来这干嘛? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Balboa, what's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.38,1:01:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我发迹的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where I started.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.41,1:01:58.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你的问题  我们在他们打死我们之前离开吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's your problem. Let's leave before they leave us for dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.40,1:02:04.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到他们的眼神了吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see that look in their eyes?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.40,1:02:09.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我们比赛时  我练得很辛苦  但我眼中没有那种眼神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we fought I trained hard, but I didn't have that look in my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.41,1:02:11.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有  所以你赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had it, and you won.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.38,1:02:14.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得把那种眼神找回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta get that look back.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.33,1:02:18.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兄弟  老虎般的眼神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eye of the tiger, man. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.35,1:02:19.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来  我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.35,1:02:23.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看这地方  一点水准也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this place. No class in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.36,1:02:26.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他一直都这么令人愉快吗?  - 我可没累着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is he always so cheerful?  - I don't sweat you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.81,1:02:28.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别心理不平衡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get mentally irregular.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.71,1:02:30.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个自由的国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a free country.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.33,1:02:31.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别不平衡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just don't get irregular.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.71,1:02:34.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要什么哲学课程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need no philosophy lesson here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.34,1:02:36.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我花了六年时间才了解他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just takes about six years to get to know him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.33,1:02:38.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可没六年的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't got six years!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.39,1:02:40.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保利  别这样  放轻松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Paulie. Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.42,1:02:44.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们做正事呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on business.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.11,1:02:49.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, champ!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.09,1:02:51.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杜克  我的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, my man!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.73,1:02:53.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's set up and ready to go, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.10,1:02:55.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你认识他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you know who this man is.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.10,1:02:58.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和你一起工作会很愉快的  而非对立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be good working with you. Certainly had enough of working against you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.03,1:03:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你觉得如何?  - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do you feel?  - Pretty good, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.03,1:03:03.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一直活得很现代  但训练要用旧方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been living modern, but now we're gonna train old.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.09,1:03:05.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要和这些人谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going over here and talk to some of the guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.09,1:03:08.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冠军回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The champ is home!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.05,1:03:12.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得离开了  我的名声可是很好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've gotta leave. I've got a reputation.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.03,1:03:14.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思  名声?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, reputation?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.08,1:03:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到了  我不喜欢他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard. I don't like these people.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.11,1:03:18.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不喜欢他们? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't like them?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.03,1:03:22.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  也许他们也不喜欢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe they don't like you either.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.12,1:03:24.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对他们做什么了? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did I do to them?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.11,1:03:27.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们叫我重拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they call me punchy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.11,1:03:30.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杜马  来这里见见一些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stallion, come on over here and meet some of the fellas.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.04,1:03:32.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.08,1:03:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位  你们好吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doin', guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.08,1:03:48.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样  快  用脚尖跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. Come on. On the toes,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.09,1:03:50.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用脚尖跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the toes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.12,1:03:55.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.04,1:03:58.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的动作不怎么优雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He ain't too graceful.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.05,1:03:59.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们才要来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.05,1:04:02.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,浪费时间  他的脚很重的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wasting time. He's got heavy feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.08,1:04:05.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用脚跳吧  洛奇  来吧  放松些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get on the balls of your feet. Come on. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.10,1:04:08.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把脚离开水泥地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get those feet out of the concrete.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.11,1:04:10.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那得花些时间  但那会成功的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll take time, but it'll come.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.08,1:04:13.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不能依着破丛林音乐来练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can't train to the jungle junk music.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.07,1:04:16.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 洛奇  来吧  放松些  - 开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Relax, Rock.  - Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.09,1:04:18.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,协调好双脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balance your feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.05,1:04:21.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 让你的身体察觉到韵律  - 我们刚发明一种新舞叫爬行舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let your body find the rhythm.  - Start a new dance called "the crawl."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.10,1:04:24.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉你  你不能把他当成一个有色拳手来训练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't train him like a colored fighter.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.10,1:04:25.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他抓不到韵律感的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He ain't got no rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.04,1:04:29.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我看起来很蠢吧?   - 你看起来很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How stupid do I look?   - You look great
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.09,1:04:33.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们做的每一件事  都是为了练习刺拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything we do works off the jab.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.08,1:04:36.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会游泳吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can he swim?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.03,1:04:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是指洛奇吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a name like Rock?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.11,1:04:41.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没时间浪费了  快练习吧  再一圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No time to waste. Let's go. Another lap. Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.03,1:04:43.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快游  再一圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another lap!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.03,1:04:46.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可不是鲔鱼  我们是属于体育馆的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He ain't no tuna. We belong back in the gym.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.10,1:04:49.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他得利用一些  他不曾以为自己有的肌肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gotta strengthen and use muscles he never thought he had.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.03,1:04:53.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  伸展开来  洛奇  快游\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stretch, now. Move it, Rock!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.06,1:04:56.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人可以改变那么多的  他是沙包  不是拳击手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody could change that much. He's a bruiser. He ain't no boxer.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.03,1:04:59.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续这么说  他会变得一无是处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You keep telling him that and he'll be nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.06,1:05:03.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是吗?  - 再一圈  来吧  快游\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah?  - Another lap! Come on, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.05,1:05:05.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快  快游\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Move it! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.12,1:05:07.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  洛奇  快游\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it, Rock! Come on! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.10,1:05:10.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样了  伸展  伸展开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it, stretch it. Stretch it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.33,1:05:12.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样  快游吧  你得用力拉  加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. You gotta pull hard, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.62,1:05:24.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴  你这无赖  我要揍扁你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up, you Sterno bums! I'll squash ya!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.70,1:05:27.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有体面的人正想睡觉呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's decent people trying to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.11,1:05:30.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴  你这低级混蛋的人渣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up, you honky scum bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.04,1:05:32.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁需要这恶心的地方? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who needs this sick place?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.10,1:05:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.05,1:05:37.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没水准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No class.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.05,1:05:42.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死  那个克劳伯很强壮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, that Clubber's strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.11,1:05:45.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,15回合是很长的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifteen rounds is a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.09,1:05:48.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得趁早把他摆平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta put him away early.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.06,1:05:53.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为步伐必须调整  洛奇还可以维持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figure with the pace we gotta set, Rock can last maybe...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.38,1:05:55.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许七或八回合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}seven or eight rounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.09,1:05:58.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再过去我们就没辄了  兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we'll be out of steam, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.08,1:06:01.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得趁早摆平他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to put him away early.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.08,1:06:07.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少水还是热的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least the water's hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.29,1:06:12.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们从未度过真正的蜜月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we never really had a honeymoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.06,1:06:17.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也没那么糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.08,1:06:21.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一直处于恶劣环境中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been in worse places.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.03,1:06:25.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇在第二回合有了麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky's in trouble in round two!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.08,1:06:29.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,右勾拳  又一记右勾拳  洛奇遭到痛击 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He takes a right and then an upper! He's been cut! Rocky's been cut!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.05,1:06:36.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快动吧  你得更厉害些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.10,1:06:39.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,流畅的思考  流畅些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta get tougher. Think smooth.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.12,1:06:43.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脚趾  用脚趾跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bounce, bounce, bounce. Toes, toes. On your toes
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.04,1:06:47.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  逼迫自己  集中注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Push yourself! Concentrate!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.09,1:06:49.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  快移动吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's move it! Move it now!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.07,1:06:51.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Rocky, come on
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.12,1:06:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放松  放松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have fun with this. Have fun with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.12,1:06:57.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,流畅点  用脚趾跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. Easy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.04,1:07:01.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别逼它  让它自然出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't push it. Let it come.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.08,1:07:05.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝  它会出现的  只是得花些时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll come. It just takes time, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.07,1:07:09.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  移动你的头  把你的头上下移动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Move your head. Up and down.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.04,1:07:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,流畅点  上下滑动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Slip now, up and down.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.08,1:07:15.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝  进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In and out. Inside. Inside, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.12,1:07:17.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从一边到另一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Side to side. Move your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.06,1:07:20.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注意  记住  他有两只手  好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch him, now. Remember, he's got two hands, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.04,1:07:27.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死  你究竟在干嘛? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, man! What the hell you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.06,1:07:30.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙会打烂你屁股的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy will knock you on your ass!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.40,1:07:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  来吧  这不是游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. It's not a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.11,1:07:37.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次你想在医院躺五个星期吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna live in the hospital for five weeks this time?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.42,1:07:40.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我这样就很厉害了吗?  他会杀了你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You thought I was tough?  This chump will kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.09,1:07:44.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好的  - 把脑袋装到肩膀上去好吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right.  - Get your head on your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.05,1:07:46.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想想那场比赛  想想那场比赛 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about the fight. Think about the fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.08,1:07:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克劳伯廉他想伤害你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clubber Lang's in, and he's trying to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.11,1:07:50.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  他来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.76,1:07:53.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他正在刺拳  他正想伤害你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's jabbing. He's trying to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.09,1:07:55.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得打赢他  你得移动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} You gotta fight him. Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.03,1:08:08.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他逮到你了  他逮到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's hooking. He's hooking.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.06,1:08:10.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋  洛奇  得了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, Rock, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.03,1:08:12.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么了? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.09,1:08:14.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天  我们明天再练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow. Let's do it tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.03,1:08:17.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经没有明天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.12,1:08:19.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有明天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.09,1:08:23.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有明天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.07,1:08:31.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  你只要记住一件事  我们得快些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, there's just one thing that you gotta remember. We gotta get some speed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.10,1:08:35.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得有弹性些  你得快速移动  知道吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta get some flexibility. You gotta get some quickness. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.70,1:08:37.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快速  忍耐  - 这就是结尾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Quickness and endurance.  - That's the end of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.10,1:08:40.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是我们唯一关心的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the only thing we gotta concern ourselves with.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.12,1:08:42.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米克从不叫我这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mickey never had me do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.09,1:08:46.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  我们开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.04,1:08:49.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.08,1:08:55.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 准备  - 好  - 开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Set?  - Yeah  - Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.30,1:08:57.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.08,1:09:09.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.06,1:09:12.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  你赢不了的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't win, Rock!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.04,1:09:17.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自从得那奖牌后  就失去战意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't been hungry since you won that belt.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.05,1:09:21.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会把你轰到未来去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll knock you into tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.09,1:10:06.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.07,1:10:09.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.06,1:10:11.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.11,1:10:24.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你究竟是怎么了? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.10,1:11:02.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能和你谈谈吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I talk to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.03,1:11:10.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要问你一些重要的事  我也想要你告诉我事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna ask you something important and I want you to tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.04,1:11:12.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.07,1:11:14.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么来这里? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.08,1:11:18.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再也不要了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just don't want it no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.05,1:11:22.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果它的结束是你要它结束的话  我很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it's over because you want it to be over, I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.06,1:11:24.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是要结束它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.11,1:11:29.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是  从我认识你以来  你从未放弃过什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just you've never quit anything since I've known you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.11,1:11:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你要我说些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what you want me to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.03,1:11:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说如何?  怎么了? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.06,1:11:40.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么以往都是那么好的东西  如今都变的那么坏? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did everything that was so good get so bad?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.06,1:11:44.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事坏了  告诉我  什么? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's so bad?  Tell me, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.08,1:11:47.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我为自己着想  而坏了一切事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wrecked everything by not thinking for myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.11,1:11:51.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么米克不告诉我怎么开始是正确的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why couldn't Mickey tell me where it was right from the start?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.06,1:11:54.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没有必要带领我  对我撒谎  使我以为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't have to carry me and lie to me and make me think...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.09,1:11:57.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 自己比真实的还要好  - 他没有撒谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I was better than I really was when I wasn't.  - He never lied.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.07,1:11:59.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些比赛是不对的  艾莉  它们不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those fights weren't right. They weren't.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.11,1:12:01.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从未和处在巅峰的人打过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never fought anybody who was all in their prime.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.12,1:12:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直有个看法  那就是我能保有更久的头衔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was always some angle to hold the title longer than I should've had it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.04,1:12:07.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你了解我在说什么吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand what I'm saying here?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.04,1:12:10.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道  但你必须知道 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand, but you've gotta understand
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.54,1:12:13.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱你和保护你是他的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he loved you and that was his job-protecting you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.05,1:12:16.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但保护一点用也没有  只会使事情更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that protecting don't help nothin'. It only makes things worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.05,1:12:19.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过去几年我一直以为我是胜利者  但如今醒来发现自己是个失败者…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wake up after a few years thinking you're a winner, but you're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.10,1:12:24.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但事实上是个失败者  所以我们不能保有头衔那么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're really a loser. We wouldn't have had the title as long.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.07,1:12:26.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但至少那也会是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what?  At least it would've been real.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.07,1:12:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was real!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.08,1:12:30.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都不是真实的  如果你都不相信自己的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing is real if you don't believe in who you are!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.07,1:12:32.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再也不信任自己了  你不明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe in myself no more! Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.12,1:12:36.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当一个拳击手不相信自己时  他就完了  结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When a fighter don't believe, that's it! He's finished! It's over!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.07,1:12:37.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 当然不是这个样子  - 当然是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's not it!  - That it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.04,1:12:39.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么不告诉我实话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you tell me the truth?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.08,1:12:41.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把我当成什么了? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you putting me through?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.10,1:12:44.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想知道事实?  事实是我不想失去我已有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna know the truth? The truth is I don't wanna lose what I got.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.04,1:12:47.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一开始我不在乎会发生什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the beginning, I didn't care about what happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.10,1:12:51.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会到擂台上  开始出拳  但现在有你  有孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd get busted up. I didn't care. But now there's you, the kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.06,1:12:55.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不想失去我所拥有的  - 我们有什么不能取代的东西吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't wanna lose what I got!  - What do we have that can't be replaced?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.07,1:12:58.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,房子吗?  我们有车子  有钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A house. We got cars, money.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.09,1:13:00.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们什么都有了就是事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got everything but the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.10,1:13:02.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死  事实是什么? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the truth, damn it?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.08,1:13:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我害怕  可以吗?  你要听我说出来吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid, all right? You wanna hear me say it?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.04,1:13:10.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我害怕  这是我一生中第一次害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna break me down? For the first time in my life, I'm afraid!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.07,1:13:13.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也害怕  但害怕并不算什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid too. There's nothing wrong with being afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.08,1:13:16.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对我而言当然是一回事  - 为什么?  你是人吧? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For me there is!  - You're human, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.09,1:13:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只知道我是个骗子  只因为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what I am. All I know is I'm a liar and because of
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.03,1:13:20.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米克不会再出现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Mickey ain't here no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.04,1:13:23.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么也没逼他做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't push him into anything!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.05,1:13:25.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个成年人了  他必须做他必须做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a grown man and he did what he had to!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.03,1:13:28.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没有权利为已发生的事内疚  没有必要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you have no right to feel guilty for what happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.07,1:13:32.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个冠军  你做别人期望你去做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were a champion and you did what you were expected to do...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.06,1:13:34.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做我和其他任何人  认为你该做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you did what I and everybody else thought you should do.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.04,1:13:39.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要告诉我那些比赛都不是真的  我不相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you wanna tell me those fights weren't real? I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.10,1:13:41.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我相信这不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it doesn't matter what I believe...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.06,1:13:44.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你是那个内心恐惧的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you're the one that's gotta carry that fear around inside you...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.07,1:13:47.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,害怕每个人都要带走你的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}afraid that everybody's gonna take things away...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.07,1:13:51.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,害怕会被人认为是个懦夫  再也不是个男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}afraid you're gonna be remembered as a coward that you're not a man anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.11,1:13:55.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一切都不是真的  我告诉你也没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, none of it's true. But it doesn't matter if I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.06,1:13:58.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你是要解决那事情的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't matter because you're the one that's gotta settle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.07,1:13:59.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快扫除这魔障吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get rid of it,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.09,1:14:03.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为当这烟雾被清除后  大家都称赞你的名字时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because when all the smoke has cleared and everyone's through chanting your name
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.10,1:14:08.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将会是我们  你不能这样活下去  我们不能这样生活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's just gonna be us! You can't live like this. We can't live like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.11,1:14:10.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为那将会困扰你的余生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause it's gonna bother you for the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.12,1:14:13.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看那现在对你的影响是怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look what it's doing to you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.08,1:14:23.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗认为你做的到  我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo thinks you can do it. So do I.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.10,1:14:26.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得为了正当理由去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you've got to want to do it for the right reasons
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.07,1:14:30.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而不是为了对米克的罪恶感  不是为了人们  不是为了头衔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not for the guilt over Mickey, not for the people not for the title,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.11,1:14:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是为了钱或是我  而是为你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not for money or me. For you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.08,1:14:36.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是你  只是你而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just you. Just you alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.08,1:14:42.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我输了呢? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if I lose?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.08,1:14:46.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么你就输了  但至少你输的没借口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you lose. But at least you lose with no excuses,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.05,1:14:48.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.04,1:14:51.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你这样可以活的心安理得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know you can live with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.08,1:15:01.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么变的那么坚强? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you get so tough?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.07,1:15:05.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我和战士在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I live with a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.12,1:15:13.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.04,1:15:22.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.09,1:15:49.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轻轻打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just flick it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.12,1:16:10.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  再五圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five more laps.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.12,1:16:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打出去  逮住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta move in faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.03,1:17:01.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快  继续努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster! Faster!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.06,1:17:04.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.07,1:17:22.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,移动头部  移动头部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move your head! Move your head!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.05,1:17:30.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.08,1:17:41.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.05,1:17:43.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,速度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speed
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.06,1:17:49.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.12,1:17:58.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像鱼的洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky is fish
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.06,1:18:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士先生们晚安  我史都纳罕和比尔鲍德温一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening, ladies and gentlemen. I'm Stu Nahan along with Bill Baldwin.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.04,1:18:59.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎你们来到麦迪逊花园广场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We welcome you to Madison Square Garden
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.03,1:19:02.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一场最激烈的拳击重赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a most-exciting backdrop for the anxiously awaited rematch
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.11,1:19:05.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前任冠军洛奇巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}between the former champion, Rocky Balboa
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.06,1:19:07.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挑战现今世界重量级拳王  克劳伯廉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the reigning heavyweight champion, Clubber Lang.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.03,1:19:12.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在镜头转至化妆间去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We now switch to our remote cameras inside the dressing rooms.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.06,1:19:16.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能透露要如何攻击巴尔博亚吗?  你的策略为何? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you care to comment on how you plan to fight Balboa? What's your strategy?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.06,1:19:17.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么也不需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't need any.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.09,1:19:20.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚易于预测而且又笨  那家伙脑袋空空的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa's so predictable and stupid. The man comes straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.32,1:19:23.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我而言他是订做的  而他将要受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's tailor-made for me, and he's gonna get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.03,1:19:27.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  把那个倒过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice, just make sure you turn them over.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.08,1:19:30.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那看起来如何  还好吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does that look? Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.04,1:19:33.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我不恨巴尔博亚  但我曾玩过那傻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't hate Balboa, but I pity the fool.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.12,1:19:37.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要摧毁任何一个想夺走我的头衔的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I will destroy any man who tries to take what I got.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.05,1:19:43.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住你是从哪里来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember where you came from.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.05,1:19:46.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住你到这儿用了多少努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember what it took to get you here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.10,1:19:50.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住他上次待你的方式  好吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you remember what he did to you last time, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.09,1:19:54.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然两个都是拳击手  优势是属于克劳伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since both men are brawlers, with the edge and power going to Lang.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.07,1:19:58.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为巴尔博亚想重赢头衔  十分困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would say that the odds are long against Balboa regaining his title.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.05,1:20:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在该你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.06,1:20:02.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该你了  对吧? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your turn, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.06,1:20:07.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你对比赛的预测如何?  - 预测? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's your prediction for the fight then?  - Prediction?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.06,1:20:09.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  预测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, prediction.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.12,1:20:12.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.12,1:20:15.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,廉是个喜欢伤人的拳击手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lang is a brawler who likes to hurt a man to the body.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.40,1:20:19.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道  从克劳伯廉残酷的痛击中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Balboa may never have psychologically recovered
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.08,1:20:22.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚永远不会回复过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from that vicious knockout that Clubber laid on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.06,1:20:23.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(教练室)
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.12,1:20:25.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.06,1:20:29.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 拿去  - 干嘛? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here.  - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.05,1:20:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你把这穿上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to wear these.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.06,1:20:38.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗  别这样  这是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Apollo. These are...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.03,1:20:42.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你我第一次比赛时你穿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the colors that you wore in our first fight together.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.11,1:20:45.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不能穿你的衣服  - 穿上吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't wear your colors.  - Just wear 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.10,1:20:51.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo, Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.08,1:20:54.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在还我之前要洗好  可以吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just make sure you wash 'em before you bring 'em back, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.08,1:20:56.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will do. Will do.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.08,1:20:58.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你  阿波罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Apollo.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.04,1:21:02.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住  之后你就欠我一份人情了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And remember. After this, you owe me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.05,1:21:04.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么人情? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What favor?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.11,1:21:06.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我同意  直接面对面的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to agree. Toe-to-toe...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.09,1:21:09.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,廉颇具毁灭性  而且他也太强了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lang is utterly devastating and he's much too strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.06,1:21:14.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  听着  我只想说我以你为荣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, listen. I just wanna tell you I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.12,1:21:16.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个人要改变必须花大把劲  但你却做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It takes a hell of a man to change, and you did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.59,1:21:18.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你今晚就要证明它  好吗  - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're gonna prove it tonight, right?  - Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.10,1:21:20.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 阿波罗  做的好  - 保利  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You did good, Apollo. - Thanks, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.65,1:21:23.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 保利  我们开始吧  - 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's do it, Paulie.  - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.04,1:21:28.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇来了  而阿波罗也来了  这两位前任拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here comes Rocky and Apollo, the two former champions.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.06,1:21:35.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look at Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.07,1:21:38.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看他的脸  紧绷的身体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at the tenseness in his face, the tautness of that body.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.07,1:21:41.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他看起来可真严肃  - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Boy, does he look serious right now.  - He certainly does.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.06,1:21:45.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道  这是洛奇最后一战了  不管输赢或是平分秋色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know, the word is this is Rocky's last fight win, lose or draw.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.04,1:21:50.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他上台了  意大利杜马洛奇巴尔博亚  他正走上擂台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there he is. The Italian Stallion Rocky Balboa, climbing into the ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.12,1:21:52.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他看起来可真瘦  对吧? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy, he looks incredibly thin, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.04,1:21:55.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜他一定瘦了20磅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say he's gotta be about 20 pounds lighter.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.09,1:21:58.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇巴尔博亚  费城来的铁人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky Balboa, the iron man from Philadelphia.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.08,1:22:01.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚观众一定站在他那边  你听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this crowd is certainly with him tonight. Listen
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.07,1:22:05.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚其实并没有什么拳击技巧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balboa doesn't really have any boxing skills.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.12,1:22:08.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从未见过一个拳击手  有这么强的决心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen a fighter with as much raw determination.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.10,1:22:10.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  史都  看看我们的后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it, Stu. Here comes the champion now.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.10,1:22:14.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是克劳伯廉  听听这些观众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clubber Lang. Listen to this crowd.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.09,1:22:20.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看他们的眼睛  我从未见过这么阴沉的眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look at those eyes. I've never seen a guy with such sullen eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.10,1:22:21.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很强悍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is tough.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.06,1:22:24.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克劳伯  回到你的地方去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clubber, go back where you came from!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.12,1:22:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他进场时甚至殴打了一位观众  你看到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He even belted a spectator on the way in. Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.11,1:22:32.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你看看那个人  - 天啊  真是可怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look at that man.  - Boy, awesome. Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.04,1:22:34.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可怕  他很强悍  你看那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's tough. Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.09,1:22:37.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克劳伯廉  世界重量级冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The heavyweight champion of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.05,1:22:39.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 只要快速  - 你  蠢蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just keep it as quick  - Hey, fool!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.04,1:22:41.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你准备好再挨打了吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ready for another beating?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.08,1:22:43.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不该再回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should've never came back.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.11,1:22:44.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别看他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look at him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.04,1:22:46.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们冷静些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just be cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.06,1:22:47.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.10,1:22:49.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.12,1:22:52.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我修理他后  你就是下一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After I crucify him, you're next.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.10,1:22:54.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让我看见你  傻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just stay out of my face, chump.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.11,1:22:55.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别背对着我  小人  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't turn your back on me, sucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.04,1:22:58.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铃响前就开始打斗了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a brawl before the bell!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.07,1:23:00.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗和克劳伯廉要吵架了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo and Clubber wanna go at each other right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.07,1:23:03.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铃声就要响了  比赛就要正式开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing is ready to explode! The fight is about to begin,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.08,1:23:05.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这些家伙现在就想开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but these guys wanna start right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.08,1:23:06.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别这样  - 放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on  - Let me go, let me go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.03,1:23:08.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要逮住你  放开他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get you! Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.04,1:23:10.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.10,1:23:12.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开他  我要他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go! I want him!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.12,1:23:14.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我想你说过要冷静  - 那就是冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I thought you said, "Be cool."  - That was cool!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.04,1:23:18.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是冠军   我会像上次一样揍你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the champ! I'll beat ya like I did last time!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.05,1:23:21.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不必找我了  我在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't have to look to find me! I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.06,1:23:24.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位女士先生  及世界上的拳击迷们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen, and boxing fans on the round of world
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.10,1:23:27.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光临麦迪逊广场花园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Madison Square Gardens...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.07,1:23:31.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,观赏今晚的世界重量级冠军赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and tonight's heavyweight championship of the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.08,1:23:33.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,观众们都准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This crowd is ready tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.08,1:23:35.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那红色角落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the red corner
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.09,1:23:37.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挑战者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the challenger...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.10,1:23:40.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重191磅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}weighing 191 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.04,1:23:44.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从费城来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the fighting city of Philadelphia...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.08,1:23:47.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前世界重量级拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the former heavyweight champion of the world...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.04,1:23:50.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意大利杜马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Italian Stallion...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.07,1:23:53.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.04,1:24:03.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想说  他变得好瘦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you something. He has so slimmed down...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.05,1:24:04.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来像是中量级\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he looks like a middleweight.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.07,1:24:06.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在蓝色角落里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of the blue corner...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.03,1:24:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重237磅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}weighing 237 pounds...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.11,1:24:13.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出拳猛烈  来自芝加哥的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the hard-punching battler from Chicago...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.05,1:24:18.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现任世界重量级拳王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the reigning heavyweight champion of the world...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.08,1:24:21.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克劳伯廉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clubber Lang!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.08,1:24:24.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裁判路菲利普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Referee Lou Filippo.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.09,1:24:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  两位  我们开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, boy, let's go
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.04,1:24:29.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们讨论过规则了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We went over the rules yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.10,1:24:31.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在此重复几点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just gonna repeat a few of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.12,1:24:34.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当心腰部以下和对准后颈的攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's watch your low blows and the rabbit punches.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.09,1:24:37.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一有人被击倒  你们就到角落去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In case of a knockdown, you go to the corner I tell you to
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.07,1:24:40.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并待在那里直到我要你们出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you stay there until I tell you to come out.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.06,1:24:43.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,懂吗?  有问题吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that understood? Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.07,1:24:45.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  现在回到各人的角落去  让我们开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let's go back to your corner now. Let's go
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.10,1:24:48.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要打烂你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna bust you up.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.07,1:24:50.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽管来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.10,1:24:55.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始了  战争开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, here we go. The war is on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.10,1:24:57.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在等待着铃声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're just waiting for the bell.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.08,1:24:59.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我拿冠军带  我要逮住那蠢蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take my belt off. I'm gonna beat that chump.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.10,1:25:03.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让这无赖使你依他的方式打斗  你是最强的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let this bum let you fight his fight. You're the best!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.06,1:25:04.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧  冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go, champ.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.53,1:25:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,节奏和力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rhythm and power.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.53,1:25:09.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 保持那个刺拳  - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keep that jab up.  - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.06,1:25:18.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备看第一回合了吗?  一定很精彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're ready for round one now. Should be a great fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.07,1:25:19.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比赛开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.03,1:25:22.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他直接离开他的角落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky goes right out of his corner!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.05,1:25:23.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在紧逼克劳伯廉 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He goes right after Clubber Lang!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.81,1:25:25.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,移动正确并且左拳击中廉的脸部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's throwing rights and lefts into Clubber's face.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.11,1:25:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个猛烈的开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a start of a fight here!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.08,1:25:30.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又一个刺拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another jab. Another jab.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.04,1:25:32.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是刺拳  这可不是印象中的洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And another. This is not the Rocky we expected.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.06,1:25:34.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他像阿波罗那样跳跃移动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dancing like Apollo Creed.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.05,1:25:35.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他看起来美妙极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.12,1:25:41.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又一记右拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another right.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.08,1:25:44.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一记右拳  你看他左右摆动的头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a right. Look at that right to left to the head!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.08,1:25:46.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,廉搞不清楚发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clubber Lang doesn't know what's happening right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.12,1:25:50.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他被这种方式刺伤了  你看他打的好拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's being stunned by this style. Look at the shots he's taking.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.09,1:25:55.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信  但他压制不了洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe I'm saying this, but he can't corner the challenger.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.06,1:25:58.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那双脚滑溜溜的挑战者  真不可思议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's absolutely unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.09,1:26:03.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只能打这么用力吗?  来打我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Bring it to me! Hit me!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.09,1:26:06.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那右手就像是支轻快的铁锤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That right hand is just like a trip hammer.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.33,1:26:12.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 洛奇  缠住他  - 出拳打我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rocky, tie him up!  - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.06,1:26:15.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打我吧  退回去  来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit me! Step back! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.06,1:26:18.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是棘手的第一回合…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tough first round! Tough first round!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.07,1:26:21.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇对廉打出几套组合拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's Rocky with a couple of rights and lefts to Lang.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.06,1:26:22.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.06,1:26:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在廉要卷土重来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This crowd's going absolutely wild!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.06,1:26:27.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,群众正在变得兴奋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The folks are becoming absolutely wired
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.06,1:26:34.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是洛奇左右拳的组合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a good left-right combination by Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.04,1:26:36.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一记好的左拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a good left hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.10,1:26:43.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚是属于洛奇巴尔博亚的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Rocky Balboa's night.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.06,1:26:58.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一回合结束时  我们见到一场混战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got pandemonium in the ring at the end of round one.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.05,1:27:02.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,廉还要再打  他不了解这一回合已经结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lang wants more. He can't realize the round is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.06,1:27:04.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他试着回到洛奇身旁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's trying to get back to Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.07,1:27:06.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  你看起来很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, all right. You look great.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.05,1:27:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别疯了  我们在休息区了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just don't get crazy and we're home.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.11,1:27:09.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老兄  我要宰了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill you, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.06,1:27:11.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙很强壮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man is strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.10,1:27:14.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要在下回合杀了他  我要杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next round, I'm gonna kill him! I'm gonna kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.11,1:27:18.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在他陷入困境了  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, he's gonna come hard, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.12,1:27:20.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要一直缠着他  别让他有机会喘息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep crowding him. Don't give him a chance to set.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.11,1:27:23.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,数节奏并移动 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Counter and move. Counter and move.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.10,1:27:28.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不认为廉知道第一回合 是什么东西打了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think Lang knew what hit him in this whole first round.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.07,1:27:31.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又开始了  第二回合铃响了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.03,1:27:34.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在廉走出来要找洛奇  但现在洛奇在他的角落里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it's Lang coming out strong at the start of round two.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.07,1:27:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他又走回来了  但洛奇仍挥动着左右拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky's still landing those rights and lefts.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.11,1:27:43.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他现在在台中央使用右拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's using his right in the center of the ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.08,1:27:46.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个接一个的右拳  他真的是在摆布他  右拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's really setting him up. Right, right, right!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.73,1:27:49.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五记没有还手的好拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five unanswered shots.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.12,1:27:50.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.03,1:27:57.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.09,1:27:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到这来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back there!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.07,1:28:04.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.07,1:28:10.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开他  快  分开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Break it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.07,1:28:11.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干嘛? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.09,1:28:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.10,1:28:15.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要好好地揍你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get those feet moving!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.08,1:28:17.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手举起来  快  洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.11,1:28:22.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那记右拳又击中洛奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That right hand hurt Rocky again.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.06,1:28:26.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,廉把他逼到角落去了  巴尔博亚有些小麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got him in the corner. Balboa's in a little trouble now.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.43,1:28:32.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死  抓住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold him, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.11,1:28:36.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇  快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Rocky!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.06,1:28:39.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到目前为止这回合属于克劳伯  他有了动力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Clubber's round so far. Lang is taking the momentum here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.12,1:28:43.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他逼住了巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hold Balboa
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.04,1:28:48.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 巴尔博亚倒了  - 你最好站起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And Balboa is down!  - You'd better get up
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.07,1:28:49.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站起来  该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.03,1:28:51.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.10,1:28:53.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他站得起来吗?  他有麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can he get up?  He's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.12,1:28:55.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他站起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's up!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.12,1:29:01.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而克劳伯又来了  带了记左拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here comes Clubber again. Lang with the left hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.12,1:29:03.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又一记左拳  现在是右拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lang with another left hand. Now a right.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.03,1:29:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,右拳  又一记右拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another right! Another right!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.04,1:29:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚又倒地了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And down goes Balboa again!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.12,1:29:10.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停止比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop the fight!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.07,1:29:12.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,六\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.11,1:29:15.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有些招式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got some more for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.07,1:29:17.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还有许多招式  来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a lot of moves. Come on. Here we go again.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.11,1:29:19.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克劳伯走向他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clubber coming into him.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.07,1:29:29.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没那么差的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't so bad!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.10,1:29:32.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没那么差的  - 你一定是疯了或什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You ain't so bad!  - You must be crazy or something!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.12,1:29:34.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我疯了?   - 你只是个蠢蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm crazy?  - You're just a stupid fool!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.05,1:29:38.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 但我可没喘得那么厉害  - 他是个傻瓜  笨蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I ain't breathing heavy!  - He is a fool!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.03,1:29:41.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遭受那样的重击他怎么恢复过来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could he come back from a beating like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.07,1:29:43.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你究竟在干嘛? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.10,1:29:46.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  那是战术  我知道我在干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a strategy, that's all. I know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.05,1:29:47.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  你不知道你在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know what you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.10,1:29:48.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会袭击你的  你是冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gotta come to you! You're the champ!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.57,1:29:50.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他什么也不是  他是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's nothing! He's mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.58,1:29:53.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你直接面对这无赖的话  他会杀了你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stand toe-to-toe with this bum and he'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.09,1:29:55.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让自己的头被打掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't take a man to stand there and get your head beat off.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.20,1:29:57.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别让...  - 他已经累了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't...  - He's getting tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.39,1:30:00.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别浪费你的拳头  你是冠军了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, don't go wasting your punches! You're the champ!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.50,1:30:03.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别想一拳击垮他  用用脑子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't try to take him out with one punch! Use your head!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.38,1:30:05.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他累垮  他是我们的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you wear him down, he's all ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.33,1:30:07.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我在干嘛  我发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what I'm doing. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.62,1:30:09.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别告诉我你的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell me what you think!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.70,1:30:12.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到那里去完成它  老虎般的眼神  懂了吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go out there and do it. Eye of the tiger. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.58,1:30:13.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.12,1:30:17.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去把他的头打掉  他只是个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go out there and knock his head off. He's just a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.84,1:30:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要比他更像个男人  老虎般的眼神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be more man than him! Eye of the tiger!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.51,1:30:22.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老虎般的眼神  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eye of the tiger!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.43,1:30:23.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从上到下  从左到右\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up to down, side to side
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.63,1:30:27.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是第三回合  艰难的一回合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The beginning of round three. Tough rounds to call right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.67,1:30:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一开始有一些缓慢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a little slower than the start.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.11,1:30:32.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这回合是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my round.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.05,1:30:34.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这回合是我的  我这次会击垮你的  - 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's my round. I'm gonna take you this time.  - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.12,1:30:37.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要打败你  你是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna take you. You're mine. You're mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.11,1:30:41.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来吧  - 我要打垮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on.  - I'm gonna get you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.87,1:31:00.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out there
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.04,1:31:04.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刺他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stick him!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.12,1:31:17.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他要被宰了  - 他不是要被宰了  他是快疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's getting killed!  - He's not getting killed. He's getting mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.10,1:31:20.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全世界都在看着  来  把我击垮吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole world's watching. Knock me out!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.03,1:31:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来  用力地打我吧  快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can hit hard! Hit me harder!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.12,1:31:32.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.07,1:31:48.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈打的都比那还用力  再用力点  打脸上吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother hits harder than that! A little harder! Hit me in the face!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.31,1:31:52.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来吧  快  你还不赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again! Come on! You ain't so bad!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.04,1:32:20.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可能了解战术了  他要使克劳伯廉错过机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might believe the strategy now. He's making Clubber Lang miss now.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.07,1:32:24.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看他如何引诱他了吗?  看看洛奇出的拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See how he drew him in?  Now Rocky's throwing the punches. But look at the punches.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.52,1:32:31.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他正用打在肋骨上的拳  把他轰到台下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's lifting him off the canvas with those punches to the ribs!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.10,1:33:00.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.05,1:33:11.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.12,1:33:14.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.04,1:33:30.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这地方已一片混乱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The place has gone berserk!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.06,1:33:31.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是了不起的东山再起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a tremendous comeback!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.03,1:33:33.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.10,1:33:38.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五、六、七\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five. Six. Seven.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.07,1:33:40.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,八、九\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight. Nine.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.08,1:33:43.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十  你出局了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten. You're out!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.06,1:33:46.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是新的世界重量级拳王了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The new heavyweight champion of the world
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.05,1:33:53.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there he is
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.05,1:33:58.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新的世界重量级拳王  洛奇巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The new heavyweight champion of the world, Rocky Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.11,1:34:02.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇精疲力竭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky is exhausted!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.06,1:34:06.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.04,1:34:10.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位女士先生  以击倒而获胜的冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen, the winner by knockout
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.03,1:34:12.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.10,1:34:15.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会再好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never better.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.04,1:34:20.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再次地  世界重量级冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The heavyweight champion of the world...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.05,1:34:21.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意大利杜马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Italian Stallion
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.54,1:34:23.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.11,1:34:26.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛奇巴尔博亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rocky Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.66,1:34:34.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快  我们有过协议的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. We made a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.64,1:34:36.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道  但这是很疯狂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, but this is extremely crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.65,1:34:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是心理不平衡  对吧?   - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's mentally irregular, right?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.67,1:34:41.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心理能使一切事情合理  你欠我一个人情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it makes all the sense in the world. You owe me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.66,1:34:44.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道  但你什么时候想到这主意的? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. When did you think of this?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.66,1:34:46.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大约三年前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.63,1:34:49.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真是太疯狂了  阿波罗  - 杜马  你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is very crazy, Apollo.  - Look, Stallion
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.64,1:34:52.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你上次赢的时候  你一秒就赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you won that last fight, you won by one second.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.42,1:34:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一秒钟就打败我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You beat me by one second.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.71,1:34:56.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这对我很难接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's very hard for a man of my intelligence to handle.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.32,1:34:59.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你不是说  你已学会如何和它共存了吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't you say after I beat you, you learned how to live with it?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.68,1:35:02.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我骗你的  - 你骗我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I lied.  - Oh, you lied.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.70,1:35:06.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你现在得向自己证明  对吧? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now you just gotta prove it to yourself, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.63,1:35:09.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只为了我自己  没有电视  报纸  只有你跟我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No TV, no newspapers. Just you and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.37,1:35:12.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都没有  只有你跟我  人得敬老尊贤的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing. Just you and me. Age before beauty.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.37,1:35:15.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 随你怎么说  杜马  - 我会尽全力的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Anything you say, Stallion.  - I'll do all the work.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.72,1:35:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗  你最好慢一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you, you better go slow...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.71,1:35:19.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你已不再年轻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'cause you ain't as young as springtime anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.65,1:35:21.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还年轻得足以揍扁你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still young enough to whip your butt, Stallion.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.64,1:35:22.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.72,1:35:26.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到呢?  你把你所知的都教我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you gonna do that?  You taught me everything you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.18,1:35:29.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几乎一切都教我了  你得记住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost everything. You gotta remember, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.20,1:35:32.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打得很好  但我是更伟大的拳击手  准备好了吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fight great, but I'm a great fighter. You ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.65,1:35:34.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.67,1:35:35.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.92,1:35:39.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道  杜马  人变老真的是太糟了  对吧? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Stallion? It's too bad we gotta get old, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.67,1:35:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波罗  继续打吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just keep punching.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.29,1:35:46.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要敲钟吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna ring the bell?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.29,1:35:50.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Ding, ding.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.66,1:35:53.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.72,1:35:56.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.95,1:36:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  对老人来说  你移动得很快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy, you really move good for an older guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.37,1:36:03.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看起来很好  我把你教的很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're looking good, Stallion. I taught you well.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.70,1:36:05.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为你把我教的太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you taught me too good.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.72,1:36:07.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你可以飞的  - 小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can fly.  - Look out, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.71,1:36:10.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不想要这个的  来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't want any of this. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.68,1:36:13.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来吧  - 也许我是和错的人在这里吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on.  - Maybe I'm in here with the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.72,1:36:16.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来吧  小心自己  - 准备好了? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watch yourself.  - Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.66,1:39:27.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,[谨以此片永远怀念珍·奥莉佛]
